  "type_pretty": "∀ {d : ℕ},\n  5 ≤ d →\n    Odd d →\n      ∃ c₁ > 0,\n        ∃ c₂,\n          ∀ᶠ (n : ℕ) in Filter.atTop,\n            ↑(d / 2 - 1) / (2 * ↑(d / 2)) * ↑n ^ 2 + c₁ * ↑n ^ (4 / 3) ≤ ↑(Erdos1085.f d n) ∧\n              ↑(Erdos1085.f d n) ≤ ↑(d / 2 - 1) / ↑(d / 2) * ↑n ^ 2 + c₂ * ↑n ^ (4 / 3)"
